37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, the absence rate is a symptom, not the cause. My findings confirm the cooking duty consumed two hours daily. We must eliminate that operational drain to retain members.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
